# --- Contact form (Web3Forms) ---
# The contact form delivers messages to your inbox via Web3Forms.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter your email (divyapatelgm220604@gmail.com).
# 2. Copy the free Access Key they email you.
# 3. Create a file named  .env  next to this one and paste:
#
#      VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#
# 4. Restart the dev server (npm run dev).
# Until a key is set, the form gracefully opens the visitor's email app instead.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
